d rain.","w":0.36250717163085938,"x":0.055438350941738788},{"text":"This rain can destroy farmers' crops and kill fruit trees","x":0.055555569088216003,"y":0.24854651183598564,"w":0.40444442749023435,"h":0.011627906487912454},{"text":"in the 'meadows \/ orchards \/ foothills. We must stop this","y":0.25972354287011856,"x":0.053168393915470243,"w":0.40924842834472652,"h":0.015328541969766407},{"text":"before it causes 'irreparable \/ reputable \/ undervalued damage.","h":0.013096820286342181,"x":0.05555557538232396,"w":0.42666664123535153,"y":0.27469387752679553},{"y":0.29061224454325663,"text":"Another serious problem is the 4single-use \/ once-used \/","x":0.055555555771885923,"w":0.40222221374511719,"h":0.013166825430733775},{"w":0.40888889312744142,"x":0.053333324399242488,"y":0.30367346955707375,"h":0.011836734693877693,"text":"only-time plastic which has found its way into our river."},{"text":"This has killed many fish, disrupting the food 'species \/","x":0.055555563145959892,"y":0.31673469352119099,"h":0.013207167022082356,"w":0.40222221374511719},{"y":0.3297959184574889,"text":"connection \/ chain and it must stop!","h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.053333340849663527,"w":0.26222221374511723},{"h":0.013253440856933585,"text":"I hope that all these problems can be solved promptly.","x":0.053333324122558708,"y":0.34593023241336429,"w":0.3977777862548828},{"text":"Yours faithfully,","h":0.01318343649105147,"x":0.055555557481481409,"y":0.36191860470624215,"w":0.12},{"y":0.3808139537072881,"w":0.12000000000000001,"h":0.010206454530054199,"text":"Michael Preston","x":0.055555556755555527},{"h":0.013081395674724883,"y":0.3808139531619108,"w":0.028888888359069775,"x":0.44888888918157621,"text":"15"},{"text":"2 Complete the sentences with the phrases in the box.","w":0.4488888931274414,"x":0.037777781269612516,"h":0.013102752529845052,"y":0.41424418590173628},{"h":0.013241575591418142,"w":0.3977777862548828,"x":0.084444444733669577,"y":0.44186046511685273,"text":"breeding ground built-up areas extreme hunger"},{"y":0.45632653092060127,"w":0.41333332061767569,"h":0.01315021359190649,"x":0.084444455468939777,"text":"ploughed fields thriving population water shortages"},{"text":"Due to the drought, there are serious water shortages","y":0.48401162810294296,"x":0.091111115806649462,"w":0.40888889312744148,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.08888890377340114,"w":0.38444442749023444,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"in the area which have affected crops and animals.","y":0.49836734683014616},{"x":0.064444450448233284,"h":0.01346938775510198,"text":"1 The farmer spent all day in the sun preparing the","w":0.39555553436279295,"y":0.51142857153643606},{"x":0.084279492950029816,"w":0.33809165954589848,"h":0.01534500589176091,"text":"land for growing crops and, by evening, the","y":0.5255759929339604},{"text":"_ were ready.","w":0.10038722991943361,"x":0.20869527493576207,"y":0.54139578701384672,"h":0.013138657394720643},{"w":0.40666664123535157,"y":0.55510204081619907,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.062222240021213009,"text":"2 The river water in this remote area is so clean that"},{"h":0.010365610706562944,"y":0.56967184563694218,"w":0.073395166397094716,"text":"there is a","x":0.086635748987680825},{"y":0.56976744229867948,"x":0.28666666588888889,"h":0.011627906487912454,"text":"of fish.","w":0.059999999999999998},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.58430232586214836,"x":0.062222219702609716,"w":0.3711111068725586,"text":"3 Most job opportunities are in cities and other"},{"y":0.60029069754221864,"w":0.25111110687255861,"x":0.20666666873521833,"h":0.011627907266422155,"text":"-, so many people must live and"},{"y":0.61316418682226548,"text":"work there.","w":0.084559955596923822,"h":0.010590230980698001,"x":0.088831134368384038},{"y":0.62645348825275371,"h":0.013138348326391158,"w":0.40000000000000002,"text":"4 So little food is grown in the area that the people","x":0.062222218222222313},{"y":0.64080888694296978,"w":0.082324924468994157,"text":"suffer from","h":0.010533388488146667,"x":0.088837538793443291},{"w":0.19111110687255861,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"_and something must be","y":0.64244186085488098,"x":0.29777777671186895},{"x":0.088888893901136537,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"done to help them.","w":0.1466666603088379,"y":0.65551020395489845},{"y":0.67005813977929962,"text":"5 There are strict laws to protect the","w":0.28888887405395508,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.060000002602652244},{"w":0.40685951232910161,"y":0.6844381202080535,"h":0.01367226269780375,"text":"of the turtle so that it may continue to lay eggs there.","x":0.086576226378444657},{"text":"15","x":0.46666666701695081,"w":0.026666665077209439,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"y":0.70494186079419152},{"text":"3 Complete the sentences with the missing words.","y":0.72816326493204009,"w":0.41555553436279302,"x":0.035555573077862557,"h":0.013115805022570481},{"text":"The first letters are given.","y":0.74273255838395069,"x":0.06222223312117052,"w":0.20888887405395506,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"Residents in the local villages have been told to stay","x":0.086666673333333111,"y":0.76000000033787263,"w":0.39999999999999997,"h":0.013255813754334711},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"y":0.77469387756912533,"w":0.30444442749023437,"x":0.084444456727104933,"text":"indoors while a tiger is on the loose."},{"x":0.06222223271338425,"text":"1 Trees were brought down by g -__f ____winds","y":0.78924418581089339,"h":0.013204794124681118,"w":0.41333332061767575},{"w":0.36444442749023437,"x":0.084444446847475596,"y":0.80367346950862417,"text":"and many roads were blocked during the storm.","h":0.011836734693877582},{"text":"2 A sailor was swept o _ ___--__by huge waves,","y":0.8167346935878731,"h":0.014693877551020362,"x":0.06222223374671753,"w":0.4133333206176758},{"w":0.3266666412353515,"x":0.086666683465657465,"text":"but luckily, he was saved by a rescue team.","h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.83139534908162516},{"w":0.39366577148437498,"text"